  "description": "EXPERIMENTAL. Telemetry contract for PiSharp, a port of Pi's pi-telemetry: spans, links, carriers, metrics and typed schemas, with no-op, in-memory and System.Diagnostics ActivitySource/Meter adapters, a trace store, renderTrace and an adapter conformance kit. Nothing is exported or sent anywhere unless the host attaches listeners. The API may change in any release; opt in by suppressing PISHARP_TELEMETRY001.",
